    ("h3", "4.4  System Architecture"),
    ("h5", "4.4.1  Overview"),
    ("p", "{fig:arch} shows the architecture. The browser talks to the nginx front end, which serves the page and forwards calls under /api to the gateway. The gateway verifies the token, applies the role rules and routes the call to a business service found through Eureka. The lending service calls the book and member services over REST; all other communication between business services is by events on a RabbitMQ topic exchange. Every business service keeps its data in its own PostgreSQL database."),
